# PR Review run output lands under `dev/pr-review/<base-sha-short>-<UTC-timestamp>/`
# and stays ignored with the rest of dev/. The pinned base/head fixture lives at
# `tests/fixtures/pr-review/pinned-diff-range.md`, outside dev/, so it needs no
# carve-out here.
dev/*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local benchmark runtime artifacts (reports/traces) to prevent branch checkout clashes
docs/benchmarks/B001/runs/local/
